    reg {
        name = "Start";
        desc = "Write 0, then 1. Source: OpenIPC qemu-bench docs/hisilicon-venc.md (reverse engineering of the SDK driver objects hi_vedu.o / hi_vpss.o / hi_vi.o plus a model that runs the unmodified vendor driver stack); not read from hardware. Evidence: INFERRED.";
